CB008990_DDR_Memory_POST_test_failed_fast
    [Documentation]
    ...  Purpose of this test case is to check if system correctly saves POST memory test results in RMOD logs.
    ...  Additionally results of POST memory test should be able to be collected via snapshot.
    ...  The test is intended for the following RMODs: AVQL
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param int rmod_id: (Mandatory) : RMOD configuration id of tested radio module, e.g.: 1
    ...  :param int timeBetweenSaveOnNVM_value: (Optional) : value of timeBetweenSaveOnNVM parameter for test purposes, set in decoded black_box_logger.bin RMOD file,
    ...                                                      defaults 60. Original black_box_logger.bin configuration is reverted in test teardown.
    ...  :param str snapshot_dir_path: (Optional) : absolute dir path to save snapshot file witch will be verified during the test, defaults path to test logs set during test setup.
    ...  :param str snapshot_name: (Optional) : name of snapshot to save and verify during the test, defaults snapshot_DDR_Memory_POST_test_failed.zip

    [Arguments]    ${rmod_id}
    ...            ${timeBetweenSaveOnNVM_value}=60
    ...            ${snapshot_dir_path}=${logs_path}
    ...            ${snapshot_name}=snapshot_DDR_Memory_POST_test_failed.zip
    ${bts_type}                                             hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${timeBetweenSaveOnNVM_value}                           Convert To Integer
    ...                                                     ${timeBetweenSaveOnNVM_value}
    ${blackbox_path}                                        Set variable    ${logs_path}/blackbox_file
    ${blackbox_path_after_set_post_action}                  Set variable    ${logs_path}/blackbox_file_after_post_action
    logs.create_dir_if_doesnt_exist                         dir_path=${blackbox_path}
    logs.create_dir_if_doesnt_exist                         dir_path=${blackbox_path_after_set_post_action}

    ${path_to_backup_json_dir}                              Configure NVM timeout
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     timeBetweenSaveOnNVM_value=${timeBetweenSaveOnNVM_value}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Perform RMOD Reset And Check Statuses                   rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    ${current_count_of_1416_faults}                         Get Count of 1416 faults from BBOX5
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     path_to_save_blackbox=${blackbox_path}
    Robot Log Result                                        Actual count of faults 1416 readed from RMOD's BBOX5 file is: ${current_count_of_1416_faults}.

    Create Action POST Module
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    Perform Action Get POST Result
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    Perform Action Set POST Result
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    ${expected_count_of_1416_faults_after_set_post_action}  Evaluate
    ...                                                     ${current_count_of_1416_faults} + 1

    Collect snapshot with timing                            snapshot_coverage=Full
    ...                                                     snapshot_dir_path=${snapshot_dir_path}
    ...                                                     snapshot_name=${snapshot_name}
    Check snapshot content                                  snapshot_dir_path=${snapshot_dir_path}
    ...                                                     snapshot_name=${snapshot_name}
    ...                                                     expected_count_of_1416_faults=${expected_count_of_1416_faults_after_set_post_action}
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Perform RU Power Reset And Check Statuses
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Create Action POST Module
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    Perform Action Get POST Result
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    ${current_count_of_1416_faults}                         Get Count of 1416 faults from BBOX5
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     path_to_save_blackbox=${blackbox_path_after_set_post_action}

    Should be true                                          ${current_count_of_1416_faults}==${expected_count_of_1416_faults_after_set_post_action}
    ...                                                     msg=Expected count of 1416 faults reported in BBOX5 should be equal ${expected_count_of_1416_faults_after_set_post_action}.

    [Teardown]                                              Revert Configuration of NVM timeout
